{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652270/extras/\u82f1\u6587_\u5f00\u573a\u52a8\u753b.gif?t=1747781703\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An unknown world, brutal rules, and you only have a slot machine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spin the wheel, win rewards, face continuous challenges, improve yourself, become the god of slot machines, and create miracles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652270/extras/\u82f1\u6587_\u666e\u901a\u6362\u724c.gif?t=1747781703\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A dreamlike slot machine journey\u2014challenging the impossible. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thousands of talents, unique skills, blessings from the gambling gods, combined with a touch of luck in the spin, you will ultimately surpass the limits and achieve victory!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652270/extras/\u82f1\u6587\u5929\u8d4b.png?t=1747781703\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A beginner\u2019s tip: Always have one skill ready for emergencies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652270/extras/\u82f1\u6587_\u6280\u80fd\u6362\u724c.gif?t=1747781703\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3652270?t=1747781703","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652270/77381b1bd3bdb22de33016f0b6a13263e0365cbb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747781703","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652270/89d26c84b6bce2fafc8da49fa5883c5fe132180c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747781703","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamsta